Package: viyar
Title: SAS Viya Compute and CAS Integration for R via REST
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Samiul", "Haque", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "samiul.haque@posit.co")
Description: Connect R to SAS Viya using only REST APIs. Provides compute
    session management, SAS code submission, libref and dataset discovery,
    bidirectional data transfer, Viya Files/Folders access, and caslib
    table loading with promotion. Complements 'swat' (CAS-only) and offers
    a pure-R alternative to Python-based 'saspy'/'sasr' with no Python
    dependency.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    curl,
    jsonlite,
    openssl,
    utils,
    stats
Suggests:
    rstudioapi,
    connectapi,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
